{
  "version": "2.21",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "lmAUR",
      "x": 1419,
      "y": 1062,
      "name": "H04 · 建议交互与动效说明",
      "width": 650,
      "height": 740,
      "fill": "#FAFAFA",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 26,
      "padding": 32,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "KgPuT",
          "name": "交互说明标题",
          "fill": "#252525",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "它记得背景，\n你决定从哪件事继续。",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 27,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "PRAmM",
          "name": "点一下，就开始",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "SwYxn",
              "name": "点一下，就开始 · 标题",
              "fill": "#252525",
              "content": "点一下，就开始",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "c71F1",
              "name": "点一下，就开始 · 正文",
              "fill": "#707070",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "整张卡片是一个动作入口。进入新对话，带上这件事的背景。卡片写“起草”就只起草，外部发送依实际指令与权限。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "GBGpj",
          "name": "有依据，才出现",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ZZ4zK",
              "name": "有依据，才出现 · 标题",
              "fill": "#252525",
              "content": "有依据，才出现",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "rhOKw",
              "name": "有依据，才出现 · 正文",
              "fill": "#707070",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "最多两条。来源变化、过期、被纠正或被删除时撤下。缺少完成证据，只代表未知，不写成“你还没做”。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "A9Ysy",
          "name": "留给输入的空间",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "wP3m4",
              "name": "留给输入的空间 · 标题",
              "fill": "#252525",
              "content": "留给输入的空间",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "yMhMV",
              "name": "留给输入的空间 · 正文",
              "fill": "#707070",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "点击输入框时建议退出，输入内容保留。无合适建议、离线且无有效缓存时，回到纯净首页。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "sOign",
          "name": "轻微的动，比热闹更合适",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "z6fL6",
              "name": "轻微的动，比热闹更合适 · 标题",
              "fill": "#252525",
              "content": "轻微的动，比热闹更合适",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "BNLD6",
              "name": "轻微的动，比热闹更合适 · 正文",
              "fill": "#707070",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Avatar 沿用现有轻摆与眨眼。卡片点阵默认静止，按下卡片才短暂聚拢；减少动态效果时完全静止。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "w4YJ2",
          "name": "素材表达主题，不冒充数据",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "p5GVSq",
              "name": "素材表达主题，不冒充数据 · 标题",
              "fill": "#252525",
              "content": "素材表达主题，不冒充数据",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "tteX7",
              "name": "素材表达主题，不冒充数据 · 正文",
              "fill": "#707070",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "回环、交汇与声纹是内容配图，不编码情绪、记忆可信度或录音数量。插画不是可拖动播放器。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
